eonix-mcp plugin — eonix-mem local worker
Copyright Eonix

The design of the eonix-mem worker (hook CLI, on-demand local worker, raw capture with
asynchronous LLM compression, SessionStart context injection, layered search) is inspired by
claude-mem by Alex Newman (thedotmack), https://github.com/thedotmack/claude-mem,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The code in this repository is an independent
rewrite and contains no source copied from claude-mem.

This bundle (worker/dist/eonix-mem.cjs) includes third-party npm packages, notably Express
(MIT License). Their licenses are available in their respective packages on npm.
